@startuml
title Arquitetura de Alto Nível (minimal)

left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Monospaced

rectangle "Interface" as IF
rectangle "Orchestrator" as ORCH
rectangle "CSV Pipeline" as CSV
rectangle "API GW Pipeline" as APIGW
rectangle "HTTP Clients" as CLI
rectangle "Repos/DB" as REPO
rectangle "Infra Externa" as EXT

IF --> ORCH
ORCH --> CSV
ORCH --> APIGW
CSV --> CLI
APIGW --> CLI
CSV --> REPO
APIGW --> REPO
REPO --> EXT
CLI --> EXT

note as N1
Interface:
- UploadController (REST)
- ScheduledLauncher / ExternalApiSyncScheduler
end note
N1 .. IF

note as N2
Orchestrator:
- OrchestrationService
- Dispara job CSV
- Dispara sync API GW
- Move input.csv -> input_processed.csv
end note
N2 .. ORCH

note as N3
CSV Pipeline:
- ApiSentinelJobConfig (csvReader/csvWriter)
- CsvDiscoveryService (governança, tags GitLab, inconsistências)
end note
N3 .. CSV

note as N4
API GW Pipeline:
- ApiGatewayDiscoveryService (ExternalApi, tags, GitLab -> Governança)
end note
N4 .. APIGW

note as N5
HTTP Clients (WebClient):
- ApiManagerClient (ExternalApi)
- GovernanceClient
- GitLabClient
end note
N5 .. CLI

note as N6
Repos/DB:
- AssetGWRepository
- DiscoveryLogRepository
- InconsistencyLogRepository
- H2 (JPA)
end note
N6 .. REPO

note as N7
Infra Externa:
- ExternalApi API Manager
- Governance API
- GitLab
- FS (data/, build/)
end note
N7 .. EXT

@enduml
